# Deploy on every change

This app is live at **https://olx.talbyte.com**. Hostinger auto-deploys from GitHub on every push to `main`.

## After making application changes

1. **Commit** the changes (follow the repo’s git commit protocol / HEREDOC style).
2. **Push** to `origin` `main` on [Muhammad-Talha-Qamar/olx-website-assignment](https://github.com/Muhammad-Talha-Qamar/olx-website-assignment.git).
3. Do this **without waiting** for the user to ask — a push updates the live domain.

## Scope

- Applies to app source (HTML, CSS, JS, images, assets).
- Skip push-only noise (e.g. local `.DS_Store`) unless the user asks.
- Do **not** force-push or rewrite published history unless the user explicitly requests it.
